  "citation": "Iwahana G; Hinzman L; Wilson C (2016): Time-lapse photography at BEO, Utqiagvik (Barrow), Alaska, 2014. Next-Generation Ecosystem Experiments (NGEE) Arctic. Dataset. doi:10.5440/1999388",
  "dataset": {
